    "text": "Thursday, July 30, 2026\nCora Macaluso, 6, peeks out from the window of the Jamestown Windmill during a festival Saturday to celebrate the 1787 landmark. The cloths were raised on the sails so when the wind blew, the sails spun with the breeze. Please see more photos of Windmill Day, Page 10. PHOTO BY ANDREA VON HOHENLEITEN",
